                <l xml:id="m-51f7c596-c0be-42b2-9eed-ff7f5999c496" facs="#m-6851f52f-76cb-4a2e-921b-69f3ba22086c" label="text-like">At None.</l><l xml:id="m-12f13114-bae4-4e80-9769-e6a5dfc91b7c" facs="#m-e9a7ad53-e8fe-422b-8644-c4052f9cb325" label="ambiguous">an</l><l xml:id="m-1316ddbc-ee54-4007-b8a5-419e49eea023" facs="#m-261f16ad-fbcf-4752-a88b-69586bc2b9e7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-692e4671-a87d-4048-b994-959ff64aa0dc" facs="#m-b2754495-bf7c-4430-8147-9083c5bd9569" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens tiónis est auctor; ita et immortali¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d037d13-7be7-4cf4-b8e8-5a438dfe2a78" facs="#m-b1a0dfa7-d706-4033-ba6e-b9dd570d157b" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: ut natus hódie Salvátor] tátis sit ipse largitor: Qui tecum</l><l xml:id="m-237cd2ad-e035-4e0f-b451-01b7cadede00" facs="#m-09d4aa0a-8332-4b47-9884-7f538757b0c1" label="lyrics-like">mundi, sicut divínae nobis genera¬vivit</l><l xml:id="m-b0f61279-d8a8-4b59-805b-dc393aa7313c" facs="#m-5fbf171d-e73e-42a3-8495-2de93ce7e1f7" label="text-like">Last Gospel. Cum natus esset Jesus. from the Feast of the Epiphany, p. 461.</l><l xml:id="m-151a41bc-6b3a-4ff3-bb9c-414d7c1e8859" facs="#m-294b3093-b2e3-475b-9a43-550eeedac974" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-e786ecf2-f9ac-43ad-969a-aecbf16fd60c" facs="#m-5ebb43a9-b217-4b77-bd22-ee34d641650b" label="ambiguous">Ant. Angelus. p. 397.</l><l xml:id="m-97d882c0-8f6f-492a-bd07-f8db1447fcfe" facs="#m-71d164ee-09c9-4de3-a81c-063836b499be" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f3a1ec2f-c5ba-42e3-9981-5c2069319629" facs="#m-572e2514-1ca3-428d-a34e-89315dd6415b" label="ambiguous">Heb. T. c.</l><l xml:id="m-b3158ab4-edba-46ff-9418-c09677d29f64" facs="#m-6ac9679e-f43b-46e1-9e2c-b94302be8348" label="lyrics-like">T: Tu in principio Dómine mánuum tuárum sunt caeli.</l><l xml:id="m-3724bdae-f917-4548-a5d8-a0e91f86a023" facs="#m-24f6aab7-c327-475a-b8aa-b2b18be85d11" label="lyrics-like">Ca terram fundàsti:* et ópera!</l><l xml:id="m-05980679-afee-47d9-bcea-c6da1ffdf567" facs="#m-59a371b6-2ac2-4f81-9761-22bf0f40a50f" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-3bb9c095-b789-46ba-8be7-330be2d40781" facs="#m-12adcee6-7c85-43c9-932c-f71abe353d39" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-5b4a896c-2e82-45fb-adb6-062dabe66f29" facs="#m-6f3da9a2-fe09-4fcc-9392-672903b6db09" label="lyrics-like">AL Otum fé-cit Dóminus: “Alle-lú-ia, alle lú-ia. V. Sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ae0d276-3917-4cca-b08b-12b3f28f1c09" facs="#m-a6973cd6-ab1c-48d7-b810-c0ea874c6320" label="lyrics-like">lutá-re sú-um. Gló-ri-a Pátri. as here under.</l><l xml:id="m-36ae8c4c-da26-497a-986a-61cda7407f6f" facs="#m-342d8fa9-93fb-4c8e-8011-beaa2ab45a70" label="lyrics-like">v. Vidérunt ómnes fines térrae, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-7c546d3c-a1d9-4200-81c3-1a852a61ca92" facs="#m-c1a3382d-8339-4919-ab46-3c491a918cfb" label="lyrics-like">R. Salutáre Déi nóstri, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-eb15b547-cb9c-4fcb-aae4-9c238c4ea760" facs="#m-c58316ec-58f9-4fff-bd7a-57299dcc2e56" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-9e7fc6b0-955c-4273-b276-58164bed9842" facs="#m-7e875bf3-caee-4327-b431-754b8a35f679" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Párvulus filius. p. 399.</l><l xml:id="m-9e87d0eb-b5a1-4e35-a55d-1f46a1b37afc" facs="#m-0b0994e6-98e0-42e0-bcee-ad08f18429d1" label="ambiguous">Heb. 1. d.</l><l xml:id="m-0ff38189-4b9b-46a0-a8e0-32a3e04afc02" facs="#m-bee9c32e-7645-47ae-a0e4-d382130250fb" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-fc84b73b-59fb-430a-a5a3-b3ae88d472ca" facs="#m-68b71935-4e6b-4cba-9caa-9ebcc58de57e" label="lyrics-like">"Psi peribunt, tu autem permané-] mutábis eos, et mutabúntur:* tu</l><l xml:id="m-de683b88-6589-4500-84da-04f3b87d2e6c" facs="#m-1fc08b35-b3a9-4c54-a9eb-eec36ff794f6" label="lyrics-like">I bis:t et omnes sicut vestimén-]autem idem ipse es, et anni tui non</l><l xml:id="m-3ddaf6fd-aaa0-4808-8890-afbcd36d5ea9" facs="#m-56818062-7b54-4deb-96af-cda8017ae8b3" label="lyrics-like">tum veteráscent: et velut amictum! deficient.</l><l xml:id="m-d6de7108-956b-4b11-9f54-f96570b1b659" facs="#m-4aabb8d0-b33d-4911-8809-76f0ddf9a000" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-d0655903-b8e2-4497-8222-f956d9a1b317" facs="#m-02161404-60b1-4620-af33-b981e146d3b6" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-32a3e9c3-de56-44d6-b45e-62403c35f9f3" facs="#m-8dc2ab2e-ab12-486c-9afe-529eaae9e848" label="lyrics-like">Idérunt ómnes fínes térrae:“ Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e1a0a37e-1156-49c9-bca8-1f6ffa9d0bd9" facs="#m-5601835f-a89d-478c-ba22-1d66c672f5bf" label="lyrics-like">V. Sa-lutáre Dé-i nóstri. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et</l><l xml:id="m-3265469d-e488-456f-984f-139d08ecbcd0" facs="#m-fa9cfbf6-acc4-44af-aa72-d3fa4d506310" label="lyrics-like">Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto. Vidérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-56f32b6e-4ce0-439e-9b0c-91f94104b7ce" facs="#m-ec4822d8-1ae8-4904-abcc-8a67ff4666a9" label="lyrics-like">V. Vérbum cáro fáctum est, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-45d08269-e78e-4a3f-aa8b-4fe09bba9779" facs="#m-ed3eab4c-39bd-45a2-9263-4d4f8b280203" label="lyrics-like">F. Et habitávit in nóbis, alleluia¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
